n pods are swiftly checked. Laplace finishes up what she is currently working on."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It feels like... she finally has a moment to breathe. When was the last time she got to do that?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She can't recall—there's no day or night inside this lab."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The 360-degree shadowless lights have kept her company for a very long time."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A time that feels long to any human, but far too short for the task at hand."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"White Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lady Laplace, shall I assist with anything else?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,50"}},{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":13,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No need. You're dismissed."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoWhite","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"White Nyto","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, ma'am."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_door_elecport","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once the white Nyto leaves, Laplace approaches one of the incubation pods."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bubble","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_NightVision_Start","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She opens the control panel and forcibly initiates a premature awakening of the unfinished test subject."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After a brief tremble, the girl inside the pod opens her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Why am I back here again...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't be nervous. I'm only documenting your current condition."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...You're merely sharing this body's vision."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Laplace starts adjusting various values and recording routine data."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia slams against the glass violently in protest."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Laplace does nothing to calm her down—she's clearly used to this."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me go! I don't want to stay here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How does it feel?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"To have a human's free will, and the omniscience and omnipotence of a higher life form."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's a curse."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"To possess human emotions, yet a mind and lifespan not meant for any human..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you were to become as banal as everyone else..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You'd never be the Holy Maiden. You wouldn't be worthy of sacrifice."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That sacrifice at the Gate of the Evangel... that was your doing..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You monster..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":13,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Being a Holy Maiden, embodying a miracle... Lunasia—this was all your choice."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My choice? Have I ever had a choice?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bubble","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"White froth begins to churn in the incubation fluid as Lunasia thrashes harder. Laplace merely glances at her, calm as ever."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Quiet."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you don't cooperate, we won't be able to retrieve crucial data."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Some information can only be accessed while you're conscious."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why me?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Remember your purpose."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is the path you—your past self—chose, the pact you made with me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're just one step away."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Once I personally complete the final surgery, your transformation will be complete."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":11,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Be happy, child. You got what you wanted, and I got what I wanted."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"From Pilot Whale to Hela... countless people have given everything for this moment. Now, it's time to realize it all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Laplace's aged reflection stares back from the glass, a stark contrast to Lunasia's youthful features."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She lets out a careless chuckle."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's so funny?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":12,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Laplace","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When we first met, you looked exactly the same... and I was already growing old. Human time is so short. But thank goodness—I made it in time."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The first time we met... you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops